---
title: A Personal Invitation
status: published
summary: Pursue Your Degree. Prepare for Your Calling.
---

Great Commission University of America (GCUA) provides biblically grounded, academically focused, and ministry-centered higher education for men and women called to serve Christ and His Church.

As a Pentecostal-Charismatic institution, GCUA affirms the authority of Scripture and the continuing work and power of the Holy Spirit. Our programs integrate biblical studies, theological education, spiritual formation, leadership development, and practical ministry preparation.

Whether you are preparing for pastoral ministry, Christian education, missions, evangelism, counseling, church leadership, or deeper biblical study, GCUA offers flexible learning opportunities designed to equip you for effective Christian service.

##### Study from wherever you are. Grow in knowledge. Be empowered by the Spirit. Fulfill your calling.

**Dr. Ferdinand Saerang**

President of Great Commission University of America